WEBVTT

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:25.670
Saint Seiya

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:34.310
Beyond tens of billions of light years.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:37.180
Past immense darkness.

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:44.200
The world you reach upstream
the Acheron River.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:48.510
The infinite pasture near the Lethe River.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:55.350
The utopia only those chosen
by God can enter after death.

00:01:56.130 --> 00:02:00.300
Where there is no hunger,
war, suffering or sadness.

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:06.080
A haven of eternal peace free from evil.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.130
It is called Elysion.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:15.610
I can hear my sister's voice.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:18.560
Athena's voice.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:22.590
The voices of everyone cheering me on.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:27.260
That's right, I can't give up.

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:30.150
As long as I have this life!

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.870
Exactly, Seiya.

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:35.290
Ignite your life.

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:39.860
Raise your Cosmo to the highest now.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.260
Infinitely higher than

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:47.020
you have raised it before.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.990
Impossible. The ashes of the

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:54.120
Bronze Cloth have been revived!

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:56.820
It's Kamui.

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:59.830
Hypnos, what did you just say?

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:03.800
This resurrected Cloth of Pegasus is...

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:06.270
Is Kamui, that's what I said.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.440
Kamui!

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:10.270
Get out of the way, Thanatos!

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.140
Pegasus Meteor!

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:18.770
What?

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:24.640
This is the power of the God Cloth.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:31.590
I did it. I finally defeated Thanatos.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:34.120
Seiya!

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.720
Pegasus Comet!

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:43.270
Impossible! God defeated

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:45.460
by a human.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.130
God defeated

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:49.790
by a human.

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:59.620
Awakening from A Legend

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.480
Hold on, Athena.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:05.090
I'll bring this Cloth to you soon!

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.500
Move aside, Hypnos!

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:14.460
If you don't move, I will defeat you too.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.790
Pegasus Meteor!

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:28.140
No way. Even with the God Cloth,

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:31.480
how could Pegasus have grown so strong?

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.230
I told you, I'm in a hurry.

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:36.040
Farewell, Hypnos.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.630
Wait, Pegasus.

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:41.320
Huh? Phoenix.

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:46.560
I'll be your opponent.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:47.300
What?

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:52.080
Until Seiya reaches the Hades Temple.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:54.370
Watch out, Ikki!

00:04:58.260 --> 00:04:59.480
Brother!

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:05.160
Fool. Unlike Pegasus, you
don't have The Cloths.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:09.200
How can you fight me unarmored?

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:13.040
I'll fight you anyway.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:16.360
Until Seiya...

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:20.170
Seiya reaches Athena.

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:24.490
Even if my body is torn apart

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:30.010
I will get in your way even in death.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:32.600
Then you should die.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:35.180
Reckless.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.520
Run, Ikki!

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.160
Andromeda.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:47.660
I won't let you kill my
brother. I'm your opponent!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:48.620
Shun!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.240
Fool, you should know that

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:55.490
your chain is useless.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.980
What is this chain?

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:08.540
This chain was destroyed by Thanatos.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:12.400
And yet it appears in front of me.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.740
What's this?

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:17.780
That's right. You shouldn't forget.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.780
We are also blessed by Athena's blood.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:22.760
The blood of the goddess.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:25.340
What?

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:26.540
That is...

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:27.370
Shun!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:31.530
The Andromeda God Cloth!

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:40.180
The Andromeda God Cloth.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:43.520
Shun is wearing the God Cloth.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.920
Now, hurry, brother.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:52.290
Leave this to me and go join Seiya.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:54.870
Well said, Shun.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.330
The rest is up to you.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:05.680
So now you think you can fight
me since you have the God Cloth.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:08.230
But I must tell you,

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:10.770
I'm much different than Thanatos.

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:17.610
I have no intention of being your
opponent here. Now, get out of the way!

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:21.690
Thunder Wave!

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:33.320
I see. A cornered rat bites back.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:36.850
It was what I warned Thanatos.

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:40.660
I don't think I'd get bitten,

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.240
but I'm worried about the Hades Temple.

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:46.200
I can't waste my time here.

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:48.550
I'll have to put you to sleep, Andromeda.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:52.340
Eternal Drowsiness!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.800
What is this? I'm losing my senses!

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:02.810
I don't feel pain. I don't feel anything.

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:07.310
I'm just falling into a deep sleep.

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:13.630
Shun.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:15.840
What happened?

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:20.470
Now Andromeda has fallen
into an eternal deep sleep.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.820
He will never wake up again.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:27.970
Death eliminates everything,
but sleep is harmless.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.340
I, Hypnos,

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:32.690
detest unnecessary death.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:36.210
But this boy has on the God Cloth.

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:39.860
He may be resurrected by
Athena's blood at any time.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:45.080
Though I don't want to,
I'll have to kill you.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:47.670
Wait!

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:48.420
Huh?

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:54.610
You can't forget about us.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.870
The Dragon God Cloth!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:01.230
The Cygnus God Cloth!

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:03.400
I see.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:06.400
You received Andromeda's blood

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.910
just like Pegasus and Andromeda did.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.530
I'm finally here.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:28.800
Where is Athena... Miss Saori?

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:33.910
Miss Saori!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:37.710
Athena!

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:41.090
The color of this urn! Could it be?

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:43.550
Could she have had all her blood sucked out?

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:46.760
Miss Saori, I'll rescue you now.

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:55.820
It won't even budge. What a strong urn.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:59.680
I need to hurry.

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:01.670
If I take any longer, Athena will die.

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:05.640
Take this, urn! Pegasus Meteor!

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.160
What happened?

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.920
Stop wasting your time.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:19.600
That is...

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:24.070
That urn cannot be broken by a mortal.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:28.010
If you try to break it by force,
it'll reflect back to you.

00:10:28.010 --> 00:10:30.500
And you'll end up being wounded.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:32.810
You are Hades.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:36.770
Give up. Athena is already dead.

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:42.270
Look, the urn is overflowing
with Athena's blood.

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:48.610
Athena?

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:51.660
No, I can't give up here.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.400
I'll try as many times as it takes.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.460
Pegasus Meteor!

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:02.370
Excalibur!

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.520
Aurora Thunder Attack!

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:12.980
He reflected it.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:13.640
What?

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:16.610
I told Andromeda,

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.850
but even with the God Cloths

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:22.630
you will be no match for me.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.310
Now, you guys go to sleep too.

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.340
Eternal!

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:30.590
Drowsiness!

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:34.810
Fall into eternal sleep.

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:37.930
What? The wings of God!

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:40.880
We've already seen your attack.

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:43.880
The same attack doesn't
work on a Saint twice.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.520
Take this, Hypnos!
Take this, Hypnos!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.990
Rising Dragon!

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:51.890
Diamond Dust!

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:02.310
Impossible!

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:06.260
How could they dodge the darkness
of the Eternal Drowsiness?

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:17.320
I can't believe I was defeated by mortals.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:22.120
We did it, Hyoga.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:23.800
What about Shun?

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:28.030
Shun.

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.780
Get a hold of yourself, Shun!

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:36.770
Hyoga. Where's Seiya? Where's my brother?

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:42.510
Do you still not understand?

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:45.180
Fighting any further is meaningless.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:46.810
No way.

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:51.760
All my attacks were deflected back to me.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:56.050
But I cannot give up.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:59.550
Until I save Athena.

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:03.520
Fine, you shall die with Athena.

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:05.700
Wait!

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:07.490
Ikki!

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:10.760
Seiya, are you all right?

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:12.700
Athena is...

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:14.570
Is inside the urn.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.660
What did you say?

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:19.440
But this urn won't budge.

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:21.380
We have to do something.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:24.490
Hades?

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:27.070
So that is the soul of Hades.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:32.050
Another pitiful mortal has arrived.

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:36.090
Enough! I'll finish this now!

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:38.620
Wait, Ikki!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.050
Flying Phoenix!

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:43.600
What?

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.290
Ikki!

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.340
Are you all right, Ikki?

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:57.770
I see. It's just like
when we fought Poseidon.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.840
That's right. None of
our attacks work on him.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.020
Everything is deflected.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.050
Do you understand,

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:08.530
you fools fighting against Gods?

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:12.000
Now, I will kill you both at once!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:18.970
If we combine forces we may be able
to at least save Athena from the urn.

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:22.990
However, without armors

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.360
I cannot reach my fullest strength.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.440
If I just had my Cloth...

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:29.690
If I had a Cloth.

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:35.300
What?

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.070
Ikki! What the...

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:45.610
The Phoenix God Cloth.

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:46.940
Ikki.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:52.520
Seiya, it seems Athena's blood has
also blessed me with the God Cloth.

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:53.610
Ikki.

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:55.650
All right!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:15:00.440
Let's combine our Cosmo and save Athena!

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:01.570
All right!

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:06.720
Take this!

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:09.060
Flying Phoenix!

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.530
Pegasus Meteor!

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:31.540
Even the two of us with the God
Cloths can't make it budge.

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:36.810
Is it impossible to save Athena from the urn

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:39.930
as Hades said?

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.300
The eclipse is almost complete.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:55.100
At this rate, the Earth will go dark.

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:57.210
All we can do is wait now.

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:59.960
We must have faith in Seiya and the others.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:04.450
Seiya, hang in there.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.030
Please, Seiya.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:14.500
Here comes Hades to finish us off.

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:18.210
Darn it. If we don't do anything
we'll be killed for sure.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:23.000
Seiya, what do you think about

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:25.970
that building underneath Hades?

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:26.940
What?

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:37.890
I was so focused on the tower
I didn't realize it until now.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:42.250
It looks like a tomb.

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.820
You think so too.

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:47.670
If that is a tomb...

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:55.630
Hades has put his body to
rest since ancient times.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:02.330
That must be where the body of Hades rests.

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:04.640
In that case...

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:08.970
Hades loves his body more than anything.

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:14.210
He has put it to rest since ancient
times until he takes reign of Earth.

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:18.190
Then, if we destroy Hades' body

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:21.120
he can never be resurrected.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.530
If we do so,

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.600
we might be able to change the course.

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:27.300
Let's go!

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:28.060
All right!

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:30.030
Charge at full speed!

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:33.450
Huh?

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:35.610
What do you intend to do?

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:37.720
Could you be?

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:43.650
Stop! Don't come any closer!

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:54.220
It's not something to be touched
by the dirty hands of mortals.

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.780
Stop!

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:58.500
Shut up! Hades!

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:01.460
We'll drag your body out right now!

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:02.670
Take this!

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:13.060
Hyoga, what was that explosion?

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:18.540
It's from the direction where
Seiya and brother went.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:26.410
Could they have attacked Hades' tomb?

00:18:29.070 --> 00:18:30.070
No...

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.560
Hurry and stop them.

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:37.720
Or else the world will be destroyed

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:42.520
and all of us and everything
will be obliterated.

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.380
What?

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:57.100
This is...

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.810
This is the tomb of Hades.

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:04.390
Inside here lies the resting body of Hades.

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:06.360
Ikki.

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:10.780
What?

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:21.190
What?

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:24.750
What was that?

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:39.410
What's that?

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:40.660
Could it be?

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:48.000
Hades!
Hades!

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:52.370
What was that lightning?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:57.420
The sky became dense all of a sudden.

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:01.530
Fools.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:03.080
Finally...

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.120
What?

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:08.250
Now everything will go dark.

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:11.910
Humans will die.

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:18.220
Hades has revived.

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:22.800
Shun, Hyoga, let's hurry to Seiya and Ikki.

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:24.440
Right.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:44.720
That's Hades.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:49.360
He's finally revealed himself.

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:58.290
If we just defeat him,
we can save Miss Saori.

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:04.720
Let's go, Ikki.

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:05.910
All right!

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:43.090
The urn.

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.200
The urn with Athena in it...

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:50.150
Athena!

00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:51.280
Miss Saori!

00:22:15.370 --> 00:22:16.450
Athena.

00:24:03.950 --> 00:24:06.270
Hades' slash approaches Athena.

00:24:06.270 --> 00:24:09.520
The pain called despair weighs
heavily on the Saints' hearts.

00:24:09.890 --> 00:24:11.150
However, we will not give up.

00:24:11.150 --> 00:24:13.450
We are the Saints of hope!

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:16.640
Miss Saori, please take this Athena Cloth.

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:18.830
And let's go back home to Earth.

00:24:18.960 --> 00:24:22.280
Let us finally end this endless battle.

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:25.050
Saint Seiya: To the World Filled with Light.

00:24:25.770 --> 00:24:28.240
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
